# Demo video intermediates. All rebuildable from the scripts beside them:
# frames/ and cards/ from make-intro.py + make-cards.py, vo/ from tts.mjs,
# music/*.wav from the Higgsfield job ids in music/gen*.json. 450MB of PNGs and
# audio does not belong in a git history.
videos/*/frames/
videos/*/cards/
videos/*/vo/*.wav
videos/*/music/*.wav
videos/*/work/
app/.demo-recording/

# The rendered trailers themselves — large, and reproducible from the
